  "records": [
    {
      "id": "i01",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "On the largest scales, cosmology expects the universe to look the same in every direction.",
      "text_sha256": "50b6c1cb04f9e5ae3cf1294f82e9c2f6d8d558b61e60e9326f1499456e28a207",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/i01-50b6c1cb04f9.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "f1ccabd79ef5e2e3218811096e56583d80754c142dcea6d180566cd580899de1",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "5.520000",
          "size": "88320"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i02",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "A conceptual sky of spiral galaxies should therefore show no built-in preference for clockwise or anticlockwise winding.",
      "text_sha256": "db0be38e5a642a8eeaff02dc79f8bdb2a7fede40f1ce785c9c64fc6570e4b738",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/i02-db0be38e5a64.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "ad3d68680a935ba16cd8303518c9db8fda13d0a1fe674542bbd410fc79d7932e",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.336000",
          "size": "101376"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i03",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "Galaxies acquire angular momentum while surrounding structure grows, so balance is the prediction, not an accident.",
      "text_sha256": "7b63a9b9c192024051536b4c016f1a7c252d2cc5a1b250026b110b01d1964310",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/i03-7b63a9b9c192.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "8e4e91d1b9fd6a8967c484c12ff82b0c575f35ef80070e884718276715c3487d",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.000000",
          "size": "96000"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i04",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "A preference for spiral galaxies in one sector of the sky to be left-handed or right-handed spirals would indicate a parity violating asymmetry in the overall universe and a preferred axis.",
      "text_sha256": "2e44c9feaac73b931ecf5a597aaa00957d750a2ade3a72e6e0d845fb015f0a12",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/i04-2e44c9feaac7.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "f08c103a12014f68f3e4ecc44587fc5555352fd5cc591edf1b3ffb1388250933",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "10.224000",
          "size": "163584"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i05",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "For decades, that question has been claimed, challenged, and left unsettled; this video adopts no answer.",
      "text_sha256": "28e9200e7f82a2dae08422b91f55159e09023728f95566360ebb4119a7c283a6",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/i05-28e9200e7f82.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "981eb7bb56df87c731c38fd9decac1610ef49ff303c486514165497f2f29866b",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.744000",
          "size": "107904"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "i06",
      "section": "motivation",
      "text": "The catch is that people and algorithms can carry a left-right sorting bias, so the same images need a mirror control.",
      "text_sha256": "b6ba11c74ba5d4bf1b0ad48aa8ae17c2f7210b49e307827a913b83895af4fe5b",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/i06-b6ba11c74ba5.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "f19709fe84aaa18a1156eb4149e100407521d6cf144a11e87251dc07334de44c",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.504000",
          "size": "104064"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "question",
      "text": "Can an apparent imbalance between clockwise and anticlockwise labels be separated from one introduced by the labeling process?",
      "text_sha256": "ee829c9ef24e6e96ca3b73040a8e3ac6b351571b05f9b38d478e4721891c965a",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s02-ee829c9ef24e.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "0e7dddf5260e1e79572b78c9cd9ef7c528dbf782072ccbbd81270fac88b0fdff",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "6.744000",
          "size": "107904"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "Two explanations can create the same apparent imbalance.",
      "text_sha256": "2654139c78f30dc6ac52754426d248e515600d47aef72f39a0818f5a076abd7f",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s03-2654139c78f3.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "a5f24e69ed0e14a4ea2ac15559c0ffb56fdeb8d967ab95f456ce3e7f2acffb9d",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "3.456000",
          "size": "55296"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "One places the pattern in the images.",
      "text_sha256": "c2f6b0727d046ad77d44d24a9ddd2910ba3fefd3f8dd3b7e4762a1be656bf511",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s04-c2f6b0727d04.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "ce23c7acfa745042fc5978794fe3d6f57cb796c018781d73e52478ccbdd55090",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "2.808000",
          "size": "44928"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "two-worlds",
      "text": "The other places it in the labeling process.",
      "text_sha256": "798294462935195091a0236873990264bc76d6ada3a22ec1db5760690056f6a2",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s05-798294462935.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "e3c4cba9ea288a689a94001b530d5c504aff4a92881469fc5c25fdb07bb1f4cf",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "2.088000",
          "size": "33408"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "Apply one decisive test to both worlds: mirror the same conceptual spiral horizontally.",
      "text_sha256": "ddb7198d69648c42be73567bf013379d08242dec8f7969258c638002b787455d",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s06-ddb7198d6964.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "977115cd83a32f073e69ea522be5666c7d23701e8a80448ddc75a5753438a85b",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "5.688000",
          "size": "91008"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "The geometry reverses, and its apparent label inverts from clockwise to anticlockwise.",
      "text_sha256": "4ec7573b3247d00d4b3357c7f77185bcb3383f2e0fe9cfb3049d17e2849ea0c2",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s07-4ec7573b3247.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "f28fed88b5a4c2b1b5bb895476c18a6cb96394c3cc0a3c033ca2adb8c5d34d8c",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "4.728000",
          "size": "75648"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "If the pattern belongs to the images themselves, it must follow that inversion.",
      "text_sha256": "b7adc8ea224c55c5483515e22ec16c72bfcb8b2bb6e11275866f71b3e58d1be0",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s08-b7adc8ea224c.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "850eaa5915bb52a7100022bc2cd69ec6aa4d2b1e5b71f8ae40089e1bb892211d",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "4.296000",
          "size": "68736"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "If it entered through the labeling process instead, it need not follow the pixels.",
      "text_sha256": "0de62cff2934285852f8fcd2fed708bb361076c30f7baac5726582fa26fe0bb3",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s09-0de62cff2934.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "d9151326d268bad5f786360b0251d3b3d2ace23ee5cad90380d8441328de0b9e",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
            "codec_type": "audio",
            "sample_rate": "24000",
            "channels": 1,
            "bit_rate": "128000"
          }
        ],
        "format": {
          "duration": "4.680000",
          "size": "74880"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "mirror-climax",
      "text": "One mirror, two incompatible predicted behaviors: that difference is the scientific discriminant.",
      "text_sha256": "3b19d3104719b6e7bdb6b60b6b493507c71e449b6bec1d59d93b8ba4ac9d50fc",
      "file": "audio_v4/raw/s10-3b19d3104719.mp3",
      "file_sha256": "5222858e0d5ecf270659ea51ca941aea6bc5c50d870084602373270bc1743b45",
      "probe": {
        "programs": [],
        "stream_groups": [],
        "streams": [
          {
            "codec_name": "mp3",
